license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/transport-taskweft-acp
abstract: >-
  An Agent Client Protocol agent with no language model: a deterministic grammar turns a
  prompt into a taskweft planning problem, the plan is executed step by step through the
  editor's file system and terminal under its permission, and every session is an event
  log in the workspace's FoundationDB-backed SQLite store.
